From e96197e3ca56eef18d85b1fbcbe9979d7ed397c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode <opencode@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:59:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] native: all 135 translatable QuartzCore modules compile
 to A618 ir3

A local sweep of the phone's QuartzCore default.metallib through the AIR
frontend and ir3 (same pass order as ir3_cmdline's AIR path) compiles the
same 135 modules to machine code; the six failures are the two
function-constant fixed_frag shaders and the four imageblock
tile_downsample kernels. Update the plan and NOTES; this is compilation,
not correctness.

diff --git a/NOTES.md b/NOTES.md
