index defecf2..86b3eec 100644
--- a/userspace/native/README.md
+++ b/userspace/native/README.md
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@ A passing probe looks like:
 
     probe: abi=1 input_bits=32 output_bits=36 flags=0x1 max_bo=268435456
     probe: chip=0x... va=0x... bank=... ubwc=...
-    probe: submitted 4 words, fence=0x...
+    probe: submitted 8 words, fence=0x...
